        /// <summary>
        /// Create or update shipments and order lines,  and run workflow.
        /// </summary>
        /// <remarks>
        /// If no &lt;i&gt;shipmentId&lt;/i&gt; is set, the first (and possible only) shipment is used. If a non-existing shipment ID is specific, a new shipment will be created. &lt;br /&gt;
