        /// <br/>If you create a new partial shipment and do not specify shipping information, shipping information will be copied from the previous existing shipment.&lt;br /&gt;
        /// <br/>Combination of deliveredQuantity and splitQuantity should not be used. SplitQuantity will then be ignored.
        /// <br/>&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Asynchronous processing (recommended):&lt;/b&gt; Set {enqueue: true} to process the update asynchronously via a Service Bus queue.
        /// <br/>The API returns {202 Accepted} immediately without waiting for the workflow to complete.
        /// <br/>When omitted or set to {false}, the update is processed synchronously and returns {200 OK} with the workflow result.
        /// <br/>&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
