    /// <br/>            
    /// <br/>Payment flow:
    /// <br/>1. Customer completes checkout in your storefront
    /// <br/>2. Frontend initiates payment with the provider (Klarna, Vipps, etc.)
    /// <br/>3. Provider returns transaction details (TransactionId, Amount, Status)
